{"about_the_game":"Misty Islands is an action-packed survival adventure game. After a mysterious shipwreck, you find yourself stranded on a deserted island. You must gather resources, build a home, craft equipment, and explore the islands. You must make the most of everything around you to survive and uncover the truth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Island Survival</h2>Hunger constantly threatens you, and you must ensure an adequate food supply through fishing, hunting, or gathering.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/29e1c3bb15b231f9abf74ed4262f344a.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/29e1c3bb15b231f9abf74ed4262f344a.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/29e1c3bb15b231f9abf74ed4262f344a.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Gathering</h2>All resources need to be collected, crafted, and processed by youself. Fortunately, the islands are scattered with useful resources.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/ba045667ec931b5bbbd9780324ff6064.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/ba045667ec931b5bbbd9780324ff6064.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/ba045667ec931b5bbbd9780324ff6064.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Building</h2>Utilize the limited resources on the deserted island to build a sanctuary. Crafting, forging, cooking...most importantly, you'll have a place to call home.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/93332fa56851027a01de2e83e7f781af.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/93332fa56851027a01de2e83e7f781af.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/93332fa56851027a01de2e83e7f781af.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventures</h2>Misty Islands conceal numerous relics and caves, from beast lairs to bottomless abysses. Crafting powerful weapons and armor will allow you to easily obtain hidden treasures.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/e6f15a568aeece91d347fa0efdb6b98e.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/e6f15a568aeece91d347fa0efdb6b98e.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/e6f15a568aeece91d347fa0efdb6b98e.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Naval Battles</h2>Navigate the islands, investigate the wreckage of fleets, search for survivors or victims, gather clues from them, and uncover the truth behind the shipwreck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/8a858590a291e440bd2171bb22c71193.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/8a858590a291e440bd2171bb22c71193.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/8a858590a291e440bd2171bb22c71193.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challanges</h2>Each island is controlled by a powerful force. Conquer them, face various challenges and threats, and eventually become the dominator of the misty islands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/7523c190ea6f473da1ac8d558dcd647a.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/7523c190ea6f473da1ac8d558dcd647a.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/7523c190ea6f473da1ac8d558dcd647a.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2561370?t=1759982429","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2561370?t=1759982429","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759982429","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759982429","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence"},"demos":[{"appid":2661910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>Wishlist now!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/1faaa8eb3a84b78defde0aaeb4b6367f.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=470 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/1faaa8eb3a84b78defde0aaeb4b6367f.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/1faaa8eb3a84b78defde0aaeb4b6367f.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Misty Islands is an action-packed survival adventure game. After a mysterious shipwreck, you find yourself stranded on a deserted island. You must gather resources, build a home, craft equipment, and explore the islands. You must make the most of everything around you to survive and uncover the truth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Island Survival</h2>Hunger constantly threatens you, and you must ensure an adequate food supply through fishing, hunting, or gathering.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/29e1c3bb15b231f9abf74ed4262f344a.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/29e1c3bb15b231f9abf74ed4262f344a.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/29e1c3bb15b231f9abf74ed4262f344a.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Gathering</h2>All resources need to be collected, crafted, and processed by youself. Fortunately, the islands are scattered with useful resources.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/ba045667ec931b5bbbd9780324ff6064.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/ba045667ec931b5bbbd9780324ff6064.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/ba045667ec931b5bbbd9780324ff6064.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Building</h2>Utilize the limited resources on the deserted island to build a sanctuary. Crafting, forging, cooking...most importantly, you'll have a place to call home.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/93332fa56851027a01de2e83e7f781af.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/93332fa56851027a01de2e83e7f781af.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/93332fa56851027a01de2e83e7f781af.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventures</h2>Misty Islands conceal numerous relics and caves, from beast lairs to bottomless abysses. Crafting powerful weapons and armor will allow you to easily obtain hidden treasures.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/e6f15a568aeece91d347fa0efdb6b98e.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/e6f15a568aeece91d347fa0efdb6b98e.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/e6f15a568aeece91d347fa0efdb6b98e.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Naval Battles</h2>Navigate the islands, investigate the wreckage of fleets, search for survivors or victims, gather clues from them, and uncover the truth behind the shipwreck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/8a858590a291e440bd2171bb22c71193.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/8a858590a291e440bd2171bb22c71193.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/8a858590a291e440bd2171bb22c71193.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challanges</h2>Each island is controlled by a powerful force. Conquer them, face various challenges and threats, and eventually become the dominator of the misty islands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/7523c190ea6f473da1ac8d558dcd647a.poster.avif?t=1759982429\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/7523c190ea6f473da1ac8d558dcd647a.webm?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/extras/7523c190ea6f473da1ac8d558dcd647a.mp4?t=1759982429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["SleepyValley"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561370/he